	<section_number>38.2-4522</section_number>
	<catch_line>Misleading applications or contracts</catch_line>
	<text>
		In the operation of a plan, no person shall use any misleading subscription applications or contracts.
	</text>
	<history>1980, c. 682, § 38.1-910; 1986, c. 562.</history>
